{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08676","headline":"至鸭栏驿上白马矶赠裴侍御 · 李白","name":"至鸭栏驿上白马矶赠裴侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侧叠万古石，横爲白马矶。\n乱流若电转，举櫂扬珠辉。\n临驿卷缇幕，升堂接绣衣。\n情亲不避马，爲我解霜威。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}